{% comment %}
  Base Note Profile Queue — staging-only inert mount

  This snippet is deliberately not referenced by any template, section, or
  layout. It performs no fetch, form submission, script loading, or App Proxy
  call. It can only render when a maintainer explicitly passes both a true
  staging flag and the exact development-store permanent domain.

  Copy this into an unpublished development-store theme only. Never render it
  from the live theme, never set the expected domain to a production storefront,
  and never add a remote script URL to this file.

  Example approved-dev-theme usage:
  {% render 'basenote-profile-queue-staging-mount',
    basenote_staging_enabled: true,
    basenote_staging_shop_domain: 'REPLACE_WITH_DEVELOPMENT_STORE.myshopify.com'
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{% if basenote_staging_enabled == true and request.host == basenote_staging_shop_domain %}
  <section
    class="bn-profile-queue"
    data-basenote-staging-queue-mount="inert"
    aria-labelledby="bn-profile-queue-staging-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="bn-profile-queue-staging-heading">Profile Queue</h2>
    <p>Staging preview only. Queue data is not loaded or saved from this theme mount.</p>
    <p>When the separately approved signed App Proxy route is ready, it will replace this preview in the unpublished staging theme.</p>
  </section>
{% endif %}
